{"seq":1,"slug":"bastion-topology-trust-boundary","title":"堡垒机拓扑、信任边界与网络分区设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ssh-bastion-privileged-access-engineering/bastion-jump-architecture/bastion-topology-trust-boundary","wordCount":2984,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"堡垒机拓扑-信任边界与网络分区设计\">堡垒机拓扑、信任边界与网络分区设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>堡垒机（bastion / jump host）在协议上没有任何特殊之处——它就是一个跑 <code>sshd</code> 的普通主机。它之所以被单独设计，是因为它承担了一个<strong>结构性的角色</strong>：它是运维流量唯一被允许穿过的缝合点。一旦把这个角色画成图，问题就从&quot;怎么装一台跳板机&quot;变成&quot;边界画在哪、谁能穿、穿过去还能到哪&quot;。</p>\n<p>三个概念必须分开定义，混用是绝大多数事故的源头。**信任边界（trust boundary）**是控制策略发生变化的抽象分界线——例如&quot;从互联网进入企业网络&quot;、&quot;从普通办公网进入持卡人数据环境（CDE）&quot;。**网络分区（network zone）**是这条边界在 IP 与路由层的实现——VPC、子网、安全组、网络 ACL、防火墙 zone。<strong>堡垒机</strong>是横跨这两者的唯一受控通道。<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/53/r5/upd1/final\">NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5</a> 把前者归在 SC-7（边界保护）与 AC-17（远程访问），把后者归在 SC-7(5)（默认拒绝）与 AC-4（信息流强制）。</p>\n<p>一个常被忽略的事实：<strong>堡垒机自己就在信任边界上，而不是边界之内</strong>。它同时持有内网可达性和对外可登录性，是整张拓扑里&quot;两栖&quot;的那台机器。因此拓扑设计的核心指标不是&quot;堡垒机多强&quot;，而是<strong>堡垒机被攻陷之后，攻击者还能触达多少资产</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>reach</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>reach</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>reach</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>h</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>policy</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>allow</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{reach}} = \\sum_{h \\in H_{\\text{reach}}(b)} c_h , \\quad H_{\\text{reach}}(b) = \\{\\, h \\mid \\text{policy}(b \\to h) = \\text{allow} \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reach</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reach</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reach</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">policy</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">allow</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是主机 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 的业务权重（CDE 主机、支付网关的权重远高于无状态前端）。设计目标是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>reach</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{reach}}(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reach</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压缩到最小——这正是网络分区要解决的问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>强制点</th>\n<th>失效表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信任边界</td>\n<td>策略/合规定义</td>\n<td>审计与准入评审</td>\n<td>边界靠人记住，无技术强制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络分区</td>\n<td>VPC / 子网 / 安全组 / NACL</td>\n<td>路由与包过滤</td>\n<td>安全组&quot;临时放通 0.0.0.0/0&quot;后遗忘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>堡垒机</td>\n<td>跳板主机 / 代理</td>\n<td>认证 + 会话录制</td>\n<td>单点、会话直通内网无二次校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话通道</td>\n<td>SSH channel / 转发</td>\n<td><code>direct-tcpip</code> 授权</td>\n<td>用户把堡垒机当 SOCKS 代理用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四层未对齐时的典型症状：策略上写了&quot;CDE 只允许堡垒机进入&quot;，网络层却是整个运维子网都能路由到 CDE——<strong>信任边界停留在文档里，没有落到分区上</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  U[运维人员 / CI 机器人] --&gt;|互联网 443/22| EDGE[边界接入层&lt;br/&gt;VPN / ZTNA / SSH CA 前置]&#10;  EDGE --&gt;|仅允许堡垒机 CIDR| BZ[堡垒机分区&lt;br/&gt;无公网出向 无内网明文凭据]&#10;  BZ --&gt;|策略解析 逐主机授权| APP[应用分区&lt;br/&gt;无状态服务 / K8s 节点]&#10;  BZ --&gt;|独立策略 强审计| CDE[持卡人数据环境 CDE&lt;br/&gt;PCI DSS 隔离]&#10;  BZ --&gt;|只读 / 时间窗| OBS[可观测与日志分区&lt;br/&gt;WORM 存储]&#10;  APP -.-&gt;|默认拒绝 无横向| CDE&#10;  subgraph TZ[信任边界之外]&#10;    U&#10;  end\">flowchart TD\n  U[运维人员 / CI 机器人] --&gt;|互联网 443/22| EDGE[边界接入层&lt;br/&gt;VPN / ZTNA / SSH CA 前置]\n  EDGE --&gt;|仅允许堡垒机 CIDR| BZ[堡垒机分区&lt;br/&gt;无公网出向 无内网明文凭据]\n  BZ --&gt;|策略解析 逐主机授权| APP[应用分区&lt;br/&gt;无状态服务 / K8s 节点]\n  BZ --&gt;|独立策略 强审计| CDE[持卡人数据环境 CDE&lt;br/&gt;PCI DSS 隔离]\n  BZ --&gt;|只读 / 时间窗| OBS[可观测与日志分区&lt;br/&gt;WORM 存储]\n  APP -.-&gt;|默认拒绝 无横向| CDE\n  subgraph TZ[信任边界之外]\n    U\n  end</pre><h2 id=\"三类堡垒机拓扑与其失效模式\">三类堡垒机拓扑与其失效模式</h2><p><strong>第一类：内联边车（inline sidecar）</strong>。堡垒机与目标主机同子网、同生命周期，常见于单集群内部的运维入口。优势是延迟低、拓扑简单；代价是它继承目标主机的网络位置——堡垒机一旦被拿下，攻击者已经站在业务网段里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>reach</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{reach}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reach</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 直接等于整个子网。这类拓扑只适合&quot;目标本身就是同类资产&quot;的场景，绝不该用于生产 CDE。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类：中央跳板集群（centralized jump cluster）</strong>。所有运维流量汇聚到多可用区的堡垒机集群，集群再按策略向内分发。这是当前公有云的主流形态：AWS 的 <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/session-manager.html\">EC2 Instance Connect Endpoint / Systems Manager Session Manager</a>、GCP 的 <a href=\"https://cloud.google.com/iap/docs/using-tcp-forwarding\">IAP TCP 转发</a> 都是这个模式的托管实现。它的价值在于<strong>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条点对点信任关系收敛成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 条到中心的 + 中心到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 条受控的</strong>，让策略有一处可落。失效模式是<strong>中心化放大</strong>：集群所在子网成为全流量枢纽，一旦被突破，攻击者获得的是一个&quot;能连一切&quot;的起点。缓解手段是让堡垒机<strong>不持有任何长期凭据</strong>（短时证书，见同hub的 <a href=\"../ssh-ca-keyless-access/ssh-certificate-authority-model\">SSH CA 与免密钥访问模型</a>），并把它的出向规则限制为按需注入。</p>\n<p><strong>第三类：分布式零信任代理（distributed ZTNA proxy）</strong>。没有固定的&quot;跳板网段&quot;，每个目标主机上跑一个轻量代理，代理主动向控制面建立出向长连接，控制面只做授权决策。<a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/207/final\">NIST SP 800-207</a> 描述的正是这种&quot;策略引擎 + 策略执行点分离&quot;的形态。它把信任边界从&quot;网络位置&quot;迁移到&quot;身份 + 设备态势&quot;，代价是每个目标都要装入代理、且控制面本身成为新的高价值目标。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>拓扑</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>reach</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{reach}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reach</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 规模</th>\n<th>策略落点</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内联边车</td>\n<td>整个子网</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>单集群开发环境</td>\n<td>无隔离，等同直连</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中央跳板集群</td>\n<td>全部登记资产</td>\n<td>中心一处</td>\n<td>多云生产、合规环境</td>\n<td>中心放大、单点容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式 ZTNA</td>\n<td>单主机粒度</td>\n<td>控制面</td>\n<td>混合云、BYOD、外包</td>\n<td>代理供应链、控制面被攻陷</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境电商常见的是<strong>混合</strong>：生产 CDE 用中央跳板集群（合规审计要求会话可录制、可回放），跨区域边缘节点用 ZTNA 代理（节点分散、运营商网络不可预期）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信任边界的划法-从网络位置到身份\">信任边界的划法：从网络位置到身份</h2><p>传统划法用&quot;网络位置&quot;定义信任：能路由到 = 被信任。这在多账号云环境下迅速失效，因为 VPC 对等连接、Transit Gateway 的默认路由会把大量主机变成&quot;内网邻居&quot;。正确的划法是<strong>每一跳都重新做一次授权</strong>，把边界切细到可以独立审计的粒度。</p>\n<p>实践上有三条可落地的规则。其一，<strong>默认拒绝且无内网例外</strong>：SC-7(5) 要求未明确允许的流量一律丢弃；运维网段到 CDE 的规则不得写成&quot;内网全通&quot;。其二，<strong>每跳一个身份决策</strong>：从边界接入层到堡垒机是一次认证，从堡垒机到目标主机是<strong>第二次、独立的</strong>授权，不能用&quot;已登录堡垒机&quot;当作&quot;有权访问全部目标&quot;。<a href=\"https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/document_library/\">PCI DSS v4.0.1</a> 的 1.3.1 与 1.3.2 明确要求限制 CDE 与不可信网络之间的入/出向流量，7.2 则要求按业务需要最小化访问——两层要求分别落在分区与身份上，不能互相顶替。其三，<strong>边界要有物理或技术上的不对称</strong>：允许入向的路径不应同时允许出向，堡垒机所在分区应当<strong>没有直连内网的默认路由</strong>，只能通过显式注入的转发或代理到达目标。</p>\n<p>边界切多细，可以量化为穿透成本。设穿越第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层边界需要攻击者完成的独立突破为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_k &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，表示至少需要一次额外的凭据窃取或漏洞利用），则从外部到目标的总成本为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{total}} = \\prod_{k=1}^{n} e_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 从 1 提到 3（边界 → 堡垒机 → 目标），总成本呈乘积增长，而非线性叠加。这正是&quot;堡垒机 + 分区&quot;相对&quot;直连生产机&quot;的结构性收益——<strong>它不依赖任何一层绝对安全</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络分区与东西向流量的收敛\">网络分区与东西向流量的收敛</h2><p>分区设计的难点从来不是&quot;能不能划&quot;，而是<strong>东西向流量的收敛</strong>：运维需求天然是点对点、临时的，而分区要求是稳定、可枚举的。收敛的抓手是把&quot;运维访问&quot;从网络层上移到通道层。</p>\n<p>SSH 的 <code>direct-tcpip</code> 与 <code>forwarded-tcpip</code> 通道（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html\">RFC 4254 §7</a>）是这一手段的协议基础：客户端可以在已认证的 SSH 连接上请求转发任意 TCP 目标。这既是运维便利的来源，也是分区失效的来源——<strong>如果不禁用或严格限制，堡垒机就等价于一个内网 SOCKS 代理</strong>，用户能用它绕过所有网络分区。加固要点是：在堡垒机的 <code>sshd_config</code> 上关闭 <code>AllowTcpForwarding</code>（或设为 <code>local</code> 仅允许本地转发），把 <code>PermitOpen</code> 限制为白名单目标，并用 <code>Match User</code> 按角色分别授权。</p>\n<p>云上分区的具体落地有三层控制，粒度从粗到细：<strong>网络 ACL</strong>（子网级、无状态、按序放行）负责隔离大网段，例如把 CDE 子网与普通运维子网彻底断开；<strong>安全组</strong>（实例级、有状态）负责允许&quot;仅堡垒机安全组&quot;访问 CDE 的 22 端口，用安全组引用而非 CIDR 表达意图，避免 IP 漂移导致的误放通；<strong>主机防火墙</strong>（<code>nftables</code> / <code>iptables</code> / 云主机防火墙）作为最后一层，即使前两层被误配也能兜底。三层同时存在不是冗余——<a href=\"https://www.cisecurity.org/cis-benchmarks\">CIS Benchmarks</a> 对 Linux 服务器的网络配置检查项与云提供商的网络隔离最佳实践，均把&quot;纵深&quot;而非&quot;单层正确&quot;作为验收标准。</p>\n<p>跨区域场景还要处理<strong>数据本地化</strong>：欧盟 GDPR、以及部分市场的个人数据出境限制，要求把运维会话的录制数据留在境内。这直接影响拓扑——录制存储必须与目标主机同区域，控制面可以中心化但<strong>审计数据面必须分区域</strong>，否则合规上等同于数据出境。这是&quot;控制面与数据面分离&quot;在拓扑层的一个具体约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高可用-故障域与逃生通道\">高可用、故障域与逃生通道</h2><p>堡垒机的可用性目标不是&quot;永不宕机&quot;，而是<strong>故障时安全降级而非放开通路</strong>。常见错误是给堡垒机配一条&quot;备用直连&quot;——这条直连一旦存在，就永久地成了攻击者优先利用的路径，且往往不在审计范围内。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是三个独立的设计：<strong>多可用区多实例</strong>，让单 AZ 故障不影响接入，会话在实例间不迁移（SSH 长连接无法无缝漂移），用户重连即可；<strong>配置即代码</strong>，堡垒机实例全部不可变，任何手工改动在下次替换时消失，杜绝&quot;漂移出来的放通规则&quot;；<strong>break-glass 逃生通道</strong>，为堡垒机全栈故障准备一条受控应急路径，它必须满足三点——物理或独立身份的凭据、使用即触发高优告警、使用后强制轮换。break-glass 凭据的存放位置（离线保管箱 / 硬件令牌）本身就是一条信任边界，不能与日常运维凭据同库。</p>\n<p>容量上，单台堡垒机的会话承载由文件描述符与 CPU 加密开销共同决定。若每会话占用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 个 fd、每通道加密开销为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 个 vCPU 百分比，则单实例有效会话上限为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>nofile</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub></mrow><mi>f</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\max} = \\min\\left( \\frac{F_{\\text{nofile}} - F_{\\text{base}}}{f}, \\; \\frac{100}{c} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">nofile</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实践中 CPU 常先成为瓶颈（AES-GCM 或 chacha20 在高并发下），因此容量规划要按&quot;最坏并发&quot;而非&quot;平均并发&quot;取，并预留 break-glass 与审计导出的资源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>堡垒机是横跨信任边界的唯一受控通道，它<strong>在边界上，不在边界内</strong>；评价指标是攻陷后可达资产集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>reach</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{reach}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reach</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，不是堡垒机自身的强度。</li>\n<li>三类拓扑（内联边车 / 中央跳板集群 / 分布式 ZTNA）各有其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>reach</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{\\text{reach}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reach</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 规模与失效模式；跨境电商生产环境通常是&quot;CDE 用中央集群 + 边缘用 ZTNA&quot;的混合形态。</li>\n<li>信任边界必须落到分区上：默认拒绝、每跳独立授权、入向路径不与出向共用，三者的乘积效应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∏</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{total}} = \\prod e_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才是真正的纵深。</li>\n<li><code>direct-tcpip</code> / <code>forwarded-tcpip</code> 通道让堡垒机默认等价于内网代理，必须用 <code>AllowTcpForwarding</code> / <code>PermitOpen</code> 显式收敛，否则所有网络分区都可被绕过。</li>\n<li>分层控制（NACL → 安全组 → 主机防火墙）与不可变基础设施共同构成纵深；跨区域部署还要把审计数据面按数据本地化要求分区域存放。</li>\n<li>高可用的目标是安全降级：拒绝所有&quot;备用直连&quot;，改用受告警约束、事后强制轮换的 break-glass 通道。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"堡垒机拓扑、信任边界与网络分区设计","id":"堡垒机拓扑-信任边界与网络分区设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三类堡垒机拓扑与其失效模式","id":"三类堡垒机拓扑与其失效模式"},{"level":2,"text":"信任边界的划法：从网络位置到身份","id":"信任边界的划法-从网络位置到身份"},{"level":2,"text":"网络分区与东西向流量的收敛","id":"网络分区与东西向流量的收敛"},{"level":2,"text":"高可用、故障域与逃生通道","id":"高可用-故障域与逃生通道"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"主机证书、吊销与审计追溯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ssh-bastion-privileged-access-engineering/ssh-ca-keyless-access/host-certificate-verification-revocation"},"next":{"title":"会话代理、ProxyJump 与端口/代理转发机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ssh-bastion-privileged-access-engineering/bastion-jump-architecture/jump-host-session-broker-forwarding"}}